act review to process-scoped context by authorizing artifact review from current process refs plus current package-context pins, removing produced-by-process fallback from review target discovery, preserving package member rendering through pinned-version lookups, and fixing the stale explicit version client path so version-selection failures reload the review workspace into a bounded unavailable state instead of collapsing the workspace shell.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"reason\":\"Changed `selectArtifactVersion` to reload the review workspace with the same explicit selection when stale version lookups fail, preserving bounded unavailable target state instead of setting a fatal workspace error.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"reason\":\"Changed artifact review eligibility from current refs or produced-by-process to current refs or current package-context pins, and added a pinned-version lookup path for package review rendering.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"reason\":\"Switched selected package member rendering to the new version-specific artifact review helper so package review stays intact after the process-scope tightening.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated Convex and in-memory review target discovery to source artifact targets from current refs plus current package-context members, omitting produced-only artifacts and zero-version targets.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/review/artifact-review-panel.ts\",\"reason\":\"Clarified the bounded zero-version artifact review copy for direct empty-state review.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added client coverage proving stale explicit version failures reload the workspace into bounded unavailable state instead of collapsing the shell.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added server coverage for package-context-pinned artifact targets and zero-version omission from default review target discovery.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added server coverage for cross-process current/prior version review, pinned-context review access, unrelated produced-only artifacts staying unavailable, and explicit version requests against zero-version artifacts.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added client coverage for the bounded zero-version direct review state.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added client API coverage to preserve ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND from artifact review responses.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated the zero-version panel expectation to the new bounded empty-state copy.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Registered package-context Convex handlers and updated integration coverage to the new process-context review rules while preserving package review behavior.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":567,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":9},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts --environment jsdom\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",