/service/server/archive-api.test.ts` | derived-view refresh conflict returns `ARCHIVE_DERIVATION_CONFLICT` | Error contract coverage |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:345:| 5 Structural views | 7 | 3 | 10 | derived-view service/client |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:347:| 7 Reopen/bounded reads | 4 | 0 | 4 | archive API, derived-view service |\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:393:- latest_response_path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/007-verify.json\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:397:- latest_self_note: \"After verifier returns, accept only if verifier outcome is pass, no open findings remain, and story gate evidence remains present; otherwise route to quick-fix, continue, block, or ruling based on verifier findings.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:403:path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/007-verify.json\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:423:      title: \"Story 5: Minimal Structural Views Over Turns\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:426:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:427:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:428:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:429:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/003-implementor.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:448:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Validated Story 5 against the story spec, epic tech design, and test plan; inspected the derived-view Convex storage, server services/routes, client archive rendering, fixtures, and Story 5 test coverage; then ran focused Story 5 tests plus the configured story and epic gates.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:455:        title: \"Derived-view Convex primitives are public and bypass the story's archive access controls\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:456:        evidence: \"Story 5 depends on existing archive route auth/access checks (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns.md:42-48), and the tech design says archive routes enforce actor/process access before archive services run (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:404-414). The new durable primitives in convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts:57-127 are registered with public `mutation`/`query` handlers and perform no auth or process-access check, so a caller that can reach Convex can list or replace a process's derived views without going through the protected Fastify routes.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:466:        title: \"TC-5.5b is only proven by a static fixture render, not by a real derived-view response\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:467:        evidence: \"The story maps TC-5.5b to tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts and also requires derived-view behavior to be proven through real route/service responses or durable rows rather than only a formatter (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns.md:157-181). The only TC-5.5b assertion is tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts:77-85, which renders readyDerivedArchiveViewsFixture directly; that degraded state is handcrafted in tests/fixtures/archive.ts:213-293. The server suite tests/service/server/derived-archive-view.test.ts:199-343 covers ready views, provenance, conflict, and stale rebuilds, but never exercises a real degraded derived-view response, so AC-5.5 / TC-5.5b remains unverified.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:474:          - \"TC-5.5b\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:481:        title: \"Derived-view Convex primitives are public and bypass the story's archive access controls\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:482:        evidence: \"Story 5 depends on existing archive route auth/access checks (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns.md:42-48), and the tech design says archive routes enforce actor/process access before archive services run (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:404-414). The new durable primitives in convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts:57-127 are registered with public `mutation`/`query` handlers and perform no auth or process-access check, so a caller that can reach Convex can list or replace a process's derived views without going through the protected Fastify routes.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:492:        title: \"TC-5.5b is only proven by a static fixture render, not by a real derived-view response\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:493:        evidence: \"The story maps TC-5.5b to tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts and also requires derived-view behavior to be proven through real route/service responses or durable rows rather than only a formatter (docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns.md:157-181). The only TC-5.5b assertion is tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts:77-85, which renders readyDerivedArchiveViewsFixture directly; that degraded state is handcrafted in tests/fixtures/archive.ts:213-293. The server suite tests/service/server/derived-archive-view.test.ts:199-343 covers ready views, provenance, conflict, and stale rebuilds, but never exercises a real degraded derived-view response, so AC-5.5 / TC-5.5b remains unverified.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:500:          - \"TC-5.5b\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:517:        - \"TC-5.5b\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:537:      - \"No fake adapter or placeholder execution branch was found in the runtime derived-view generation path beyond the access-control bypass called out above.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:545:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/007-verify.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:556:path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/003-implementor.json\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:576:      title: \"Story 5: Minimal Structural Views Over Turns\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:577:    planSummary: \"Implemented Story 5 end-to-end by adding durable derived-archive-view storage functions, a deterministic derived-view service over rebuilt turns, authenticated list/refresh archive routes, archive-page client loading/rendering for structural views, and Story 5 server/client/Convex coverage for ready, degraded, stale-rebuild, and conflict flows.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:584:        reason: \"Implemented deterministic turn_range and chunk_candidate generation, degraded-state propagation, and refresh conflict detection.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:590:        reason: \"Added authenticated derived-view list and refresh API routes under the process archive path.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:596:        reason: \"Initialized derived-view state on the archive surface.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:605:        reason: \"Added the client rendering surface for structural derived views, provenance, boundaries, and degraded states.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:611:        reason: \"Updated derived-view fixtures to use deterministic structural labels and explicit turn ranges.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:620:        reason: \"Added Story 5 server coverage for structural views, provenance, stale rebuilds, and archive-readable failure behavior.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:623:        reason: \"Updated archive page test state to include derived-view data.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:626:        reason: \"Updated archive page test state to include derived-view data.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:629:        reason: \"Added client coverage for ready/degraded derived-view rendering on the archive page.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:665:        - \"Filled the missing Story 5 backend slice by adding derived-view persistence, generation, and archive routes instead of leaving only Story 4 turn derivation.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:667:        - \"Added degraded-state and conflict-path coverage so refresh failures do not mask canonical archive reads.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:674:    recommendedNextStep: \"Run the manual archive checklist against a live local stack (`pnpm run convex:dev` and `pnpm dev`) to verify the archive page shows structural derived views and degraded states correctly in-browser.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:682:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/003-implementor.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/05-minimal-structural-views-over-turns/story-lead/prompts/001-pl