 TC-1.2b | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` | `TC-1.2b rejects unsupported archive entry kind` | Invalid kind creates no row |\\n    51\\t| TC-1.3a | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` | `TC-1.3a reads entries in stable sequence order` | Ascending sequence |\\n    52\\t| TC-1.3b | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` | `TC-1.3b same timestamp entries remain deterministic` | Sequence breaks timestamp ties |\\n    53\\t| TC-1.4a | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` | `TC-1.4a round-trips related ids on archive row` | Related artifact/source/tool ids return unchanged from canonical row |\\n    54\\t| TC-1.4b | `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` | `TC-1.4b archive row remains readable without related-record lookup` | Primitive read does not require enrichment |\\n    55\\t| TC-2.1a | `tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts` | `TC-2.1a raw streaming delta excluded from archive` | Delta object never calls append |\\n    56\\t| TC-2.2a | `tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts` | `TC-2.2a interrupted model output excluded` | Interrupted object ignored |\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/streams/008-verify.stdout.log:24:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_12\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"artifactsRead\\\":[\\\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\",\\\"convex/test_helpers/fake_convex_context.ts\\\"],\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\":\\\"Follow-up verification focused on the prior bounded-page blocker. Re-read the Story 3 bounded-page requirement and Flow 3 design note, inspected the updated Convex archive read path and directly touched fake Convex test helper, then reran focused archive tests and the full story gate.\\\",\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"story3-bounded-page-production-read\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"resolved\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-167` now applies the cursor in the indexed query and reads only `limit + 1` rows with `.take(...)` instead of loading the full archive with `.collect()`. Focused archive tests passed, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` also passed with the updated production path.\\\"}],\\\"newFindings\\\":[],\\\"openFindings\\\":[],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[\\\"AC-3.1\\\",\\\"AC-3.2\\\",\\\"AC-3.3\\\",\\\"AC-3.4\\\",\\\"TC-3.1a\\\",\\\"TC-3.1b\\\",\\\"TC-3.2a\\\",\\\"TC-3.2b\\\",\\\"TC-3.3a\\\",\\\"TC-3.3b\\\",\\\"TC-3.4a\\\",\\\"Non-TC: INVALID_ARCHIVE_REQUEST\\\",\\\"Scope: one bounded archive page\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"not-run\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder branch, or other non-real execution path was found in the directly touched production archive read surface.\\\",\\\"The directly touched test helper update in `convex/test_helpers/fake_convex_context.ts` aligns the fake query builder with the new indexed range operators used by the Convex query, and it did not introduce a gate regression.\\\"]}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.status.json:16:  \"artifactPath\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/005-verify.json\",\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.status.json:18:    \"stdoutPath\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/streams/005-verify.stdout.log\",\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.status.json:19:    \"stderrPath\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/streams/005-verify.stderr.log\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.status.json:22:    \"statusPath\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.status.json\",\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.status.json:23:    \"progressPath\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/progress/005-verify.progress.jsonl\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/002-story-orchestrate-run.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-orchestrate run\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"blocked\",\"outcome\":\"blocked\",\"result\":{\"case\":\"completed\",\"outcome\":\"blocked\",\"storyId\":\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface\",\"storyRunId\":\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface-story-run-001\",\"currentSnapshotPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/001-current.json\",\"eventHistoryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\",\"finalPackagePath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/001-final-package.json\",\"finalPackage\":{\"outcome\":\"blocked\",\"storyRunId\":\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface-story-run-001\",\"storyId\":\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface\",\"attempt\":1,\"summary\":{\"storyTitle\":\"Story 3: Archive Read and Reopen Surface\",\"implementedScope\":\"Implemented Story 3’s authenticated archive read surface end-to-end: added the Fastify archive HTML/API routes and archive read service, wired a new client-side archive route/state/page that loads durable archive entries without live environment dependence, and added route/rendering coverage for empty, reload, environment-loss, access-control, invalid-query, and degraded-entry cases.\",\"acceptanceRationale\":\"Story-lead could not accept the story because 3 acceptance check(s) remain incomplete.\"},\"evidence\":{\"implementorArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/003-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"selfReviewArtifacts\":[],\"verifierArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/005-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/008-v