i.test.ts:123-282`), but long-lived processes will force a full archive read on every request, which breaks the intended bounded production read behavior.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:610:        evidence: \"Story 3 scope requires 'one bounded archive page' (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:24-29`) and Flow 3 says `ArchiveReadService` fetches one bounded page from Convex (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:604-608`). The production query behind that path does not stay bounded: `convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` calls `.collect()` on every matching `archiveEntries` row and only slices afterward in `paginateArchiveEntries`. Small-fixture tests still pass (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:407-435`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:123-282`), but long-lived processes will force a full archive read on every request, which breaks the intended bounded production read behavior.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:659:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/005-verify.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:669:Path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/001-current.json\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:684:    path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-vi