 from Convex (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:604-608`). The production query behind that path does not stay bounded: `convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` calls `.collect()` on every matching `archiveEntries` row and only slices afterward in `paginateArchiveEntries`. Small-fixture tests still pass (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:407-435`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:123-282`), but long-lived processes will force a full archive read on every request, which breaks the intended bounded production read behavior.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"Scope: one bounded archive page\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"story3-bounded-page-production-read\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"The real Convex archive read path still loads the full archive before paginating\",\"evidence\":\"Story 3 scope requires 'one bounded archive page' (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:24-29`) and Flow 3 says `ArchiveReadService` fetches one bounded page from Convex (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:604-608`). The production query behind that path does not stay bounded: `convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` calls `.collect()` on every matching `archiveEntries` row and only slices afterward in `paginateArchiveEntries`. Small-fixture tests still pass (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:407-435`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:123-282`), but long-lived processes will force a full archive read on every request, which breaks the intended bounded production read behavior.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"Scope: one bounded archive page\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-3.1\",\"AC-3.2\",\"AC-3.3\",\"AC-3.4\",\"TC-3.1a\",\"TC-3.1b\",\"TC-3.2a\",\"TC-3.2b\",\"TC-3.3a\",\"TC-3.3b\",\"TC-3.4a\",\"Non-TC: INVALID_ARCHIVE_REQUEST\"],\"unverified\":[\"Scope: one bounded archive page\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"not-run\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` uses `.collect()` across the full process archive before pagination, so the real production read path is not actually bounded even though the API contract is.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder branch was found in the archive Fastify/client runtime surface; the blocker is in the real Convex read path.\",\"The Story 3 route/UI tests and `green-verify` gate pass because they exercise small fixtures and the in-memory store, so they do not expose the unbounded Convex query behavior.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/005-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-05T05:20:01.553Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-05-05T05:28:07.867Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/005-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"b11ad75a-dd58-4a13-a1e5-13b5e4de6c0b\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019df653-489e-7370-8de4-3a3f3f801119\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df653-489e-7370-8de4-3a3f3f801119\",\"storyId\":\"02-finaliz