verification.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Finalized entries render on the archive surface and empty archives show the expected empty state.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-3.2 durable reopen behavior\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json verified TC-3.2a archive survives reload and TC-3.2b archive survives environment loss.\",\"Server archive-api tests passed in focused verification.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Archive reads use durable archive state and do not depend on live environment state.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-3.3 access and error boundaries\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json verified TC-3.3a and TC-3.3b plus INVALID_ARCHIVE_REQUEST.\",\"Focused archive API tests passed.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Authenticated route and process access checks enforce unauthorized, missing process, and invalid-request behavior.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-3.4 degraded entry visibility\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json verified TC-3.4a.\",\"Verifier found no production-path findings after quick-fix.\"],\"reasoning\":\"A degraded entry remains visible with metadata and does not hide healthy archive entries.\"},{\"name\":\"Story gate\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"008-verify.json reports `corepack pnpm run green-verify` passed.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Configured story gate passed after the bounded-page fix.\"}],\"callerInputHistory\":{\"reviewRequests\":[],\"rulings\":[]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"STORY_BLOCKED\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface\",\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":\"story-orchestrate\",\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df687-1278-71d1-86dc-b5c0952ba1a6\",\"storyId\":\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df694-36f2-75f0-a722-78f0967af84