idation, per-process idempotency, sequence assignment, stable reads, and bounded page responses.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"modified\":[],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":641,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":7},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"not-run\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"Restored the missing `appendArchiveEntry` and `listArchiveEntries` exports that were causing the targeted Story 1 suite and TypeScript story gate to fail.\",\"Kept the restored implementation at the Story 1 primitive boundary only, without adding finalization-service wiring, archive routes, or read-time provenance enrichment.\",\"Revalidated the restored primitive with the targeted Convex suite and the required `green-verify` story gate.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[\"Biome still reports a pre-existing non-blocking style info in `packages/lbuild-impl/tests/unit/sdk/story-orchestrate-status.test.ts:173`, outside this story’s scope and not introduced by this follow-up.\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Return this story to verification, then continue with Story 2 for service-level finalization hooks that call the restored primitive.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/015-continue.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-05T03:41:37.934Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-05-05T03:44:19.878Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\