n-001.md:295:| TC-5.5b | `tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts` | `TC-5.5b derived view reports degraded status` | Client renders degraded view |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/streams/014-verify.stdout.log:41:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_21\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"artifactsRead\\\":[\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\"],\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\":\\\"Follow-up convergence under impl-lead ruling 012: rechecked the updated Story 1 scope/mapping docs against the current `convex/archiveEntries` and `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` surfaces, then reran the targeted Story 1 test and the configured story gate to validate current readiness.\\\",\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F1\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"resolved\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Impl-lead ruling 012 and the updated story/test-plan/tech-design text now consistently judge Story 1 on the primitive append/read boundary only. The story now rewrites AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 to primitive-level behavior and maps TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b to `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:51-97`, `156-178`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:44-54`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:563-569`). The prior scope dispute is closed.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F2\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"resolved\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The prior `collect()`-then-slice observation no longer applies because the cited `listArchiveEntries` implementation is not present in the current `convex/archiveEntries.ts`. That concern is superseded by the new blocking regression below: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are now absent entirely.\\\"}],\\\"newFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F3\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-1.1\\\",\\\"TC-1.1a\\\",\\\"TC-1.1b\\\",\\\"TC-1.1c\\\",\\\"AC-1.2\\\",\\\"TC-1.2a\\\",\\\"TC-1.2b\\\",\\\"AC-1.3\\\",\\\"TC-1.3a\\\",\\\"TC-1.3b\\\",\\\"AC-1.4\\\",\\\"TC-1.4a\\\",\\\"TC-1.4b\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true}],\\\"openFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F3\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-1.1\\\",\\\"TC-1.1a\\\",\\\"TC-1.1b\\\",\\\"TC-1.1c\\\",\\\"AC-1.2\\\",\\\"TC-1.2a\\\",\\\"TC-1.2b\\\",\\\"AC-1.3\\\",\\\"TC-1.3a\\\",\\\"TC-1.3b\\\",\\\"AC-1.4\\\",\\\"TC-1.4a\\\",\\\"TC-1.4b\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true}],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[],\\\"unverified\\\":[\\\"AC-1.1\\\",\\\"TC-1.1a\\\",\\\"TC-1.1b\\\",\\\"TC-1.1c\\\",\\\"AC-1.2\\\",\\\"TC-1.2a\\\",\\\"TC-1.2b\\\",\\\"AC-1.3\\\",\\\"TC-1.3a\\\",\\\"TC-1.3b\\\",\\\"AC-1.4\\\",\\\"TC-1.4a\\\",\\\"TC-1.4b\\\"]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"fail\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"fail\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"not-run\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` no longer provides the real Story 1 runtime path for archive entry append/read; only schema validators remain, so the production primitive itself is missing.\\\"],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"revise\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"The earlier human-ruling blocker is closed: the story, tech design, and test plan now consistently scope Story 1 to primitive append/read behavior only.\\\",\\\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder execution branch was found in the current runtime surface; the blocking issue is that the runtime primitive exports are absent, not that a fake path replaced them.\\\"]}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/003-story-orchestrate-run.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-orchestrate run\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"needs-user-decision\",\"outcome\":\"needs-ruling\",\"result\":{\"case\":\"completed\",\"outcome\":\"needs-ruling\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"storyRunId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001\",\"currentSnapshotPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-current.json\",\"eventHistoryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\",\"finalPackagePath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-final-package.json\",\"finalPackage\":{\"outcome\":\"needs-ruling\",\"storyRunId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"attempt\":1,\"summary\":{\"storyTitle\":\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\",\"implementedScope\":\"Implemented the Story 1 Convex archive append/read primitive, including per-process sequence assignment, process-scoped finalization-key idempotency, stable ascending reads by sequence, related-context id round-tripping, and persistence-focused coverage for the canonical archive entry contract.\",\"acceptanceRationale\":\"Story-lead is pausing for caller ruling 01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012 before impl-lead can accept the story.\"},\"evidence\":{\"implementorArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/004-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"selfReviewArtifacts\":[],\"verifierArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"}],\"quickFixArtifacts\":[],\"callerInputArtifacts\":[],\"gateRuns\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}]},\"verification\":{\"finalVerifierOutcome\":\"block\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F1\",\"status\":\"unresolved\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\",\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\"]},{\"id\":\"S1-F2\",\"status\":\"unresolved\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\",\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\"]}]},\"riskAndDeviationReview\":{\"specDeviations\":[],\"assumedRisks\":[],\"scopeChanges\":[],\"productionPathDecisionItems\":[{\"description\":\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\",\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null}]},\"diffReview\":{\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added the real Convex mutation