EQ-3 Convex schema includes archiveEntries, archiveTurns, and derivedArchiveViews table/index skeletons aligned to the Story 0 vocabulary\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-4 PlatformStore plus NullPlatformStore, ConvexPlatformStore, InMemoryPlatformStore, and touched test doubles expose the archive seam methods required by later stories\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-5 archive fixtures cover all seven entry kinds plus degraded entries, turns, derived views, and paginated envelopes\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-6 ProcessHistoryCompatService provides an explicit finalized-only compatibility mapping and does not backfill unsupported history kinds\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"fail\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"`corepack pnpm run verify-all` failed outside the Story 0 surface in `packages/lbuild-impl` integration suites because `zod` could not be resolved from `packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/result-contracts.ts` and `packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/runtime-identity.ts`; none of the Story 0 touched files are in that failure path.\\\",\\\"The story gate completed successfully even with a repo-wide Biome informational style notice in `packages/lbuild-impl/tests/unit/sdk/story-orchestrate-status.test.ts:173`; the notice did not fail `green-verify`.\\\",\\\"Production-path audit found no new reachable archive runtime path in Story 0 beyond seam definitions: the new archive store methods are not yet invoked by any route or service call site outside tests/platform-store scaffolding.\\\"]}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:302:| TC-5.5b | `tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts` | `TC-5