 rewrite for every caller of the three removed `artifacts` fields (`contentStorageId`, `currentVersionLabel`, `updatedAt`) including `materials-section.reader.ts`; artifact review service; content retrieval via Convex File Storage URL; artifact review panel; version switcher; URL-based version selection.\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:387:- `listArtifactVersions`\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:388:- `getArtifactVersion`\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:389:- `getLatestArtifactVersion`\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:507:`updatedAt` from `getLatestArtifactVersion(artifactId)`.\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:621:export interface ArtifactVersionSummary {\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:630:export interface ArtifactVersionDetail {\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:698:export async function listEligiblePackageArtifactVersionIds(args: {\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:702:    | 'getLatestArtifactVersion'\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:724:  eligibleArtifactVersionIds: string[];\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md:784:  exact classes such as `ArtifactVersionNotFoundAppError`,\\n./tests/service/client/a11y.test.ts:25:  markdownArtifactVersionDetailFixture,\\n./tests/service/client/a11y.test.ts:78:    onSelectArtifactVersion: vi.fn(),\\n./tests/service/client/a11y.test.ts:153:      onSelectA