ory 1 suite passed.\\\"],\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"The only open blocking finding from the prior verifier result has been verified as resolved.\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Story gate\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"018-verify.json reports corepack pnpm run green-verify passed.\\\",\\\"018-verify.json reports the targeted command corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node passed.\\\"],\\\"reasoning\\\":\\\"The configured story gate truth is green in the latest verifier evidence.\\\"}],\\\"callerInputHistory\\\":{\\\"reviewRequests\\\":[],\\\"rulings\\\":[{\\\"rulingRequestId\\\":\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"primitive-only evidence is sufficient; defer TC-1.1/TC-1.4 service/API proof\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Story 1's scoped ownership is the canonical archive-entry persistence primitive only. The story, test plan, and tech design have been aligned so service-level finalization proof belongs to Story 2 and read-time artifact/source enrichment plus lookup-failure degradation semantics belong to Stories 3 and 6. Story 1 should therefore be judged on primitive append/read evidence, taxonomy validation, ordering, idempotency, related-id storage, and bounded page shape only.\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"impl-lead\\\"}]},\\\"runtimeIdentity\\\":{\\\"version\\\":\\\"0.4.0\\\",\\\"invocationSource\\\":\\\"unknown\\\",\\\"entryPath\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\\\"},\\\"replayBoundary\\\":null,\\\"logHandoff\\\":{\\\"recommendedState\\\":\\\"STORY_BLOCKED\\\",\\\"recommendedCurrentStory\\\":\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\",\\\"recommendedCurrentPhase\\\":\\\"story-orchestrate\\\",\\\"continuationHandles\\\":{\\\"storyImplementor\\\":{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019df60d-fe28-78c2-89a0-54aa6e77481e\\\",\\\"storyId\\\":\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\"},\\\"storyVerifier\\\":{\\\"provider\