aving AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unproven\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-1.1\\\",\\\"TC-1.1a\\\",\\\"TC-1.1b\\\",\\\"TC-1.1c\\\",\\\"AC-1.4\\\",\\\"TC-1.4a\\\",\\\"TC-1.4b\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"human-ruling\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F2\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"minor\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-1.3\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"quick-fix\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":false}],\\\"openFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F1\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Story 1 scope and evidence requirements conflict, leaving AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unproven\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-1.1\\\",\\\"TC-1.1a\\\",\\\"TC-1.1b\\\",\\\"TC-1.1c\\\",\\\"AC-1.4\\\",\\\"TC-1.4a\\\",\\\"TC-1.4b\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"human-ruling\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"S1-F2\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"minor\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"AC-1.3\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"quick-fix\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":false}],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[\\\"AC-1.2\\\",\\\"TC-1.2a\\\",\\\"TC-1.2b\\\",\\\"AC-1.3\\\",\\\"TC-1.3a\\\",\\\"TC-1.3b\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[\\\"AC-1.1\\\",\\\"TC-1.1a\\\",\\\"TC-1.1b\\\",\\\"TC-1.1c\\\",\\\"AC-1.4\\\",\\\"TC-1.4a\\\",\\\"TC-1.4b\\\"]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\"],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"needs-human-ruling\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"human-ruling\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[\\\"Should Story 1 be accepted on primitive-only evidence, or are TC-1.1 and TC-1.4 intentionally still in-scope despite the scope notes that defer finalization hooks, archive API, and provenance enrichment to Stories 2, 3, and 6?\\\"],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder branch, or compatibility workaround was found in the inspected production archive persistence path; the runtime path is the real Convex mutation/query plus the real ConvexPlatformStore call-through.\\\",\\\"Both configured gates passed locally; the remaining blockers are requirement/scope proof gaps rather than format, lint, type, build, or test failures.\\\"]},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\"}],\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-05-05T03:04:18.275Z\\\",\\\"finishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-05-05T03:11:32.792Z\\\"}\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/015-continue.json:1:{\\\"command\\\":\\\"story-continue\\\",\\\"version\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"ready-for-verification\\\",\\\"result\\\":{\\\"resultId\\\":\\\"295c62fc-b827-4d07-99de-ef4611b00cd4\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt-5.4\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"story_implementor\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019df60d-fe28-78c2-89a0-54aa6e77481e\\\",\\\"continuation\\\":{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"019df60d-fe28-78c2-89a0-54aa6e77481e\\\",\\\"storyId\\\":\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\"},\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"ready-for-verification\\\",\\\"story\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\