d\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"S0-REQ-1 shared archive/turn/derived-view/pagination/error contracts and route builders exist and are exported from the shared contract root\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"S0-REQ-2 server archive schemas validate archive and turn pagination plus the empty derived-view refresh body\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"S0-REQ-3 Convex schema includes archiveEntries, archiveTurns, and derivedArchiveViews table/index skeletons aligned to the Story 0 vocabulary\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"S0-REQ-4 PlatformStore plus NullPlatformStore, ConvexPlatformStore, InMemoryPlatformStore, and touched test doubles expose the archive seam methods required by later stories\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"S0-REQ-5 archive fixtures cover all seven entry kinds plus degraded entries, turns, derived views, and paginated envelopes\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"S0-REQ-6 ProcessHistoryCompatService provides an explicit finalized-only compatibility mapping and does not backfill unsupported history kinds\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"unverified\\\\\\\":[]},\\\\\\\"gatesRun\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"productionPathFindings\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"same-session-implementor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"openQuestions\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"additionalObservations\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"`corepack pnpm run verify-all` failed outside the Story 0 surface in `packages/lbuild-impl` integration suites because `zod` could not be resolved from `packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/result-contracts.ts` and `packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/runtime-identity.ts`; none of the Story 0 touched files are in that failure path.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"The story gate completed successfully even with a repo-wide Biome informational style notice in `packages/lbuild-impl/tests/unit/sdk/story-orchestrate-status.test.ts:173`; the