stence/story-lead/001-final-package.json\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"result-envelope\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/017-story-orchestrate-resume.json\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"startedAt\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:51:23.717Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"finishedAt\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:53:19.752Z\\\\\\\"}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json:1:{\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-verify\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"needs-user-decision\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"needs-human-ruling\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"resultId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0e9a8687-385a-4fea-910a-53a721965ff0\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story_verifier\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"gpt-5.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sessionId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"continuation\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sessionId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"storyId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"mode\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"initial\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"story\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"artifactsRead\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/team-impl-log.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/004-implementor.json\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"convex/schema.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"convex/test_helpers/fake_convex_context.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/archive.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Reviewed Story 1 against AC-1.1 through AC-1.4, including the Convex archive entry mutation/query, schema and PlatformStore wiring, shared archive contracts, documented TC mappings, the local test harness, and the configured story/epic gates.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"newFindings\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Story 1 scope and evidence requirements conflict, leaving AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unproven\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"human-ruling\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\":true},{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"minor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"quick-fix\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\":false}],\\\\\\\"openFindings\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Story 1 scope and evidence requirements conflict, leaving AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unproven\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"human-ruling\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\":true},{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"minor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"titl