he latest bounded child response is a quick-fix marked ready-for-verification after a blocking verifier finding. Acceptance is not allowed until a final verifier pass confirms the fix and required Story 2 evidence, so the smallest safe next action is targeted re-verification.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"inputs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifactRefs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/002-quick-fix.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/005-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"focus\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Verify the quick-fix resolved story2-user-message-bridge-finalization-key, with focused evidence for TC-2.3b exact-once retry behavior and compatibility mapping, while confirming no new Story 2 regressions.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"selfNote\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"After this verifier returns, accept only if outcome is pass, no open findings remain, Story 2 coverage includes TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b plus live/archive separation and compatibility mapping, and the configured story gate passed.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\"}}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:19:{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_0\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"agent_message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"action\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"run-quick-fix\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The latest verifier outcome is revise with three blocking open findings, and all are marked quick-fix scope. Acceptance is not allowed until the duplicate user-message bridge path is fixed, live/archive separation coverage is added, formatting is corrected, and a later verifier pass confirms the story gate.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"inputs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"findingRefs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story2-user-message-bridge-key-mismatch\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story2-green-verify-format-failure\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story2-live-archive-separation-proof-missing\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"remediationGoal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Fix Story 2 verifier findings by preventing bridge-first accepted user responses from creating duplicate canonical archive entries, adding required live/archive separation test coverage in the designated live surface tests, correcting Biome formatting, and running focused tests plus corepack pnpm run green-verify.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"selfNote\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"After quick-fix returns, run verification focused on all three latest findings: user_message bridge duplicate prevention, live/archive separation coverage, Biome format/story gate, and full Story 2 TC coverage before considering accept-story.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\"}}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:23:{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_0\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"agent_message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"action\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"run-verify\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The latest quick-fix reports ready-for-verification after the prior verifier left three blocking findings. Acceptance is not allowed until a verifier confirms the duplicate user-message bridge path, live/archive separation coverage, formatting/story gate, and full Story 2 test coverage are all resolved.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"inputs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifactRefs\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/003-quick-fix.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/008-verify.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"focus\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Verify the latest quick-fix against all open findings from 008-verify: bridge-first and response-first user_message duplicate prevention, required live/archive separation coverage, Biome format/story gate, TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b, compatibility mapping, and configured story gate `corepack pnpm run green-verify`. Recommend pass only if no open findings remain.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"provider\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"codex\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"selfNote\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"After verifier returns, accept only if outcome is pass, no open findings remain, Story 2 coverage includes TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b plus live/archive separation and compatibility mapping, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` passed.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}\\\\\\\"}}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:27:{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_0\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"agent_message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"action\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"run-quick-fix\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The latest verifier result is revise with one blocking production-path finding: execution-res