:[\\\\\\\"Verification finding S1-F1 remains unresolved.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Verification finding S1-F2 remains unresolved.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Verification finding S1-F1 remains unresolved.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Verification finding S1-F2 remains unresolved.\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\"cleanupHandoff\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"acceptedRiskItems\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"deferredItems\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reasoning\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"approvalStatus\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"not-required\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"approvalSource\\\\\\\":null}],\\\\\\\"cleanupRequired\\\\\\\":true},\\\\\\\"rulingRequest\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"decisionType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"scope-vs-evidence-conflict\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"question\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"For Story 1, should story-local acceptance be based on the implemented primitive-only Convex append/read evidence, with TC-1.1 finalization-hook and TC-1.4 read/enrichment service/API tests deferred to later stories, or must those mapped tests and services be implemented before this story can proceed?\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"defaultRecommendation\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Rule Story 1 as primitive-only: accept Convex append/read, taxonomy validation, sequence/idempotency, related-id storage, and bounded page shape as the required evidence for this story; defer finalization hook/API enrichment tests to the later stories already named as owning that behavior. After that ruling, run a quick fix for the non-blocking pagination materialization finding if desired, then re-verify.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"Verifier artifact /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json reports status needs-user-decision and outcome needs-human-ruling.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Open blocking finding S1-F1 says Story 1 defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment while still requiring TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b evidence.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Requirement coverage in the verifier marks AC-1.2 and AC-1.3 verified, but AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unverified.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"All gates reported by the verifier passed: targeted Convex test, green-verify, and verify-all.\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"allowedResponses\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"primitive-only evidence is sufficient; defer TC-1.1/TC-1.4 service/API proof\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"TC-1.1 and TC-1.4 mapped service/API tests remain in scope; implement before acceptance\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"block story until story/test-plan wording is corrected\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\"recommendedImplLeadAction\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ask-ruling\\\\\\\"}},\\\\\\\"errors\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"warnings\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"artifacts\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-run-current\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-current.json\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-run-events\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-run-status\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.status.json\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-run-final-package\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-final-package.json\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"result-envelope\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/009-story-orchestrate-status.json\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"startedAt\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:12:39.552Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"finishedAt\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:12:39.562Z\\\\\\\"}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-events.jsonl:16:{\\\\\\\"storyRunId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sequence\\\\\\\":16,\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:37:46.839Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-lead-action-selected\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"summary\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Story-lead selected run-verify.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"actionType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"run-verify\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"turn\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"selfNote\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"After ruling application, accept only if verifier returns pass with S1-F1 resolved/nonblocking and story/epic gates remain evidenced as passing.\\\\\\\"}}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-events.jsonl:17:{\\\\\\\"storyRunId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sequence\\\\\\\":17,\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-05-05T03:37:46.840Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"story-lead-self-note-recorded\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"summary\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Story-lead recorded a durable self-note for a future planner turn.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"note\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"After ruling application, accept only if verifier returns pass with S1-F1 resolved/nonblocking and story/epic gates remain evidenced as passing.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"actionSequence\\\\\\\":16,\\\\\\\"actionType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"run-verify\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"turn\\\\\\\":1}}\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:295:| TC-5.5b | `tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts` | `TC-5.5b derived view reports degraded status` | Client renders degraded view |\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/streams/014-verify.stdout.log:41:{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_21\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"agent_message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifactsRead\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Follow-up convergence under impl-lead ruling 012: rechecked the updated Story 1 scope/mapping docs against the current `convex/archiveEntries` and `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` surfaces, then reran the targeted Story 1 test and the configured story gate to validate current readiness.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolved\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Impl-lead ruling 012 and the updated story/test-plan/tech-design text now consistently judge Story 1 on the primitive append/read boundary only. The story now rewrites AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 to primitive-level behavior and maps TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b to `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:51-97`, `156-178`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:44-54`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:563-569`). The prior scope dispute is closed.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolved\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The prior `collect()`-then-slice observation no longer applies because the cited `listArchiveEntries` implementation is not present in the current `convex/archiveEntries.ts`. That concern is superseded by the new blocking regression below: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are now absent entirely.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"newFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"same-session-implementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"openFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",