.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gatesRun\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"not-run\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"productionPathFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` no longer provides the real Story 1 runtime path for archive entry append/read; only schema validators remain, so the production primitive itself is missing.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"revise\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"same-session-implementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"openQuestions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"additionalObservations\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The earlier human-ruling blocker is closed: the story, tech design, and test plan now consistently scope Story 1 to primitive append/read behavior only.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder execution branch was found in the current runtime surface; the blocking issue is that the runtime primitive exports are absent, not that a fake path replaced them.\\\\\